ple  um you know counter misinformation  specifically as it relates to political  issues because obviously you know it  we've seen it relevant a lot during  covet but also on various other issues  that misinformation has become a very  big issue  there's no easy answer to this you know  the solution comes when everybody's your  age wyatt that's the reality you know if  we have to create i recently interviewed  dr steven novella about this who's great  on this issue critical thinking media  literacy  it's very hard  to put people in the framework of  evaluating their own thoughts  if they don't  if they're not taught to do it much  earlier on and so unfortunately i don't  want to say that the current electorate  is a lost cause it's not it's not we  still can do work there but we really  need to need to be working on these  issues when people are way younger so  they never fall for this stuff in the  first place  okay that is david pakman host of the  david packard show david thanks so much  for your time today and for providing  some of your insight wyatt this has been  great i'm going to direct people to your  channel you're doing a really great job

